# kin/youth/wear/kaftan: the youth's kaftan: long and open down the front over a linen inner garment, the edges trimmed
# in gilt (metal2), a sash in the accent at the waist; kaftan_hang carries the opening to the hem
# KIN-YOUTH (P2b wave 2). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. The girl's (`when girl replace`) narrows a pixel at the waist.
# (P2b motion rollout 2026-10-22, KIN-YOUTH) on the torso channel (keys torso): the side walk names `run` (the rest view),
# the run `runl` (rows 0-1 as rest, 2-3 a pixel back, 4 two back: under kin_youth.clip's lean 3 the chest leads the waist
# by 2 and the belt sits over hip 1); L `lie` repeats the rest view for the turned fall frames. The girl's run views carry
# the boy's belt row (and in the leaning run her waist row): the belt rides her hips, so her thighs start inside them.
# Every rest view is untouched.
use person woman
body youth
role garment kaftan
layer torso
anchor neck
keys torso

